# A Journey Begins (abyssea 160), the reply kind: a level 99 Warrior in Port Jeuno with the quest accepted (a GM). The
# login's zone-in: 324, finished: Prog 1. Joachim: 325, finished: completed, The Truth Beckons accepted. The Truth
# Beckons back to available (else its 326, also a progressEvent, would tie with 325), Dawn of Death completed (no
# section; it makes his script answer) and the quest back to accepted at Prog 1 (GMs), with no zone-in between: Joachim
# again: 325 again. (His script does nothing before Dawn of Death is accepted, and then the lookup plays the quest's
# action anyway: so the repeat needs Dawn of Death at or past accepted.) Joachim has his own onTrigger
# (xi.abyssea.traverserNPCOnTrigger): an Event-rank 325 would alternate with it (interaction_lookup.lua's UseFallback)
# and the second talk would go to his script (his 328).
lists PortJeuno/Joachim/onTrigger PortJeuno/onZoneIn/1 PortJeuno/onEventFinish/324 PortJeuno/onEventFinish/325
char zone=PortJeuno pos=-51.344,0,-9.978 job=WAR lvl=99
quest Abyssea.AJourneyBegins accepted
login open                              # Prog 0: 324
finish                                  # Prog 1
trigger Joachim                         # 325
finish                                  # completed; The Truth Beckons accepted
quest Abyssea.TheTruthBeckons available # a GM
quest Abyssea.DawnOfDeath completed     # a GM
quest Abyssea.AJourneyBegins available  # a GM
quest Abyssea.AJourneyBegins accepted   # a GM
charvar Quest[8][160]Prog 1             # a GM: Prog 1
trigger Joachim                         # 325 again (the kind)
finish                                  # completed again
